Package: miniLNM
Title: Miniature Logistic-Normal Multinomial Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kris", "Sankaran", , "ksankaran@wisc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9415-1971"))
Description: Logistic-normal Multinomial models are common in problems with multivariate count data. This package gives a simple implementation with a 30 line Stan script. This lightweight implementation makes it an easy starting point for other projects, in particular for downstream tasks that require analysis of "compositional" data. It can be applied whenever a multinomial probability parameter is thought to depend linearly on inputs in a transformed, log ratio space.
